acceptance_criteria: "Managed built-in extensions import listAllItemMetadata, LocatedItem, TemplatesSaveResult, TemplatesListResult and TemplatesShowResult from the public SDK instead of redeclaring them; A parity gate fails when a package-owned file redeclares a type or function signature that the public SDK already exports; The listAllItemMetadata arity disagreement between builtin-todos-import-export and builtin-guide-shell is resolved against the authoritative five-parameter declaration; The gate runs against the packaged artifacts so a drifted mirror cannot be published; GH-781 is closed with the parity gate named as the control that keeps it closed"
